  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Grind the onion, garlic, and ginger into a smooth paste.",
    "Heat oil in a pan and fry the cumin seeds until fragrant.",
    "Add the ground paste and cook until the raw smell disappears.",
    "Add the coriander powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook until it is lightly toasted.",
    "Add the white wine and cook until the liquid is almost completely absorbed.",
    "Place the salmon fillets on top of the rice mixture and bake for 12 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro."
